            <run>Performance Heatmap&#10;</run>
            <run fontsize='11'>Rows = Universities, Columns = Metrics, Darker = Stronger relative performance</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>Avg Score, Continuation (Normalized), Degree Completion (Normalized), Entry Standards (Normalized), Good Honours (Normalized), Graduate Outcomes (Normalized) and Research Quality (Normalized). (colour) broken down by Institution.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
